an></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Không</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Có</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Kết nối IoT</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Không</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Có</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Ghi dữ liệu lịch sử</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Không</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Có</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Cảnh báo sự cố</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Không</span></p></td><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justify;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">Có</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\"1\\" rowspan=\\"1\\"><p style=\\"text-align: justi