e information about products and quotes, please contact:</p><p>Hotline: (028)3535 8739 - 0906955459 -0931177319 -0902955119</p><p>Email: <a target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\" class=\\"text-brand-primary underline cursor-pointer\\" href=\\"mailto:info@saigonvalve.vn\\">info@saigonvalve.vn</a></p><p>Website: <a target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\" class=\\"text-brand-primary underline cursor-pointer\\" href=\\"https://saigonvalve.vn/\\">https://saigonvalve.vn/</a></p><p>Factory address 1: 124/16-18 Vo Van Hat, Long Truong Ward, Thu Duc City, Ho Chi Minh City</p><p>- Factory address 2: 48 Vo Van Hat, Long Truong Ward, Ho Chi Minh City</p><p>#SaigonValve #OKM #Exclusive Distributor #Industrial Valve #Sustainable Development #Vietnam Industry</p>", "vi": "<p> KHAI XUÂN CÔNG TY TNHH SÀI GÒN VALVE KÍNH CHÚC QUÝ KHÁCH HÀNG NĂM MỚI BÌNH AN, VẠN SỰ NHƯ Ý, AN KHANG THỊNH VƯỢNG!</p><p> ĐẦU XUÂN SÀI GÒN VALVE ĐANG SẢN XUẤT TRẠM QUAN TRẮC VÀ CÔNG NGHỆ IOT QUẢN LÝ NƯỚC SẠCH, ĐIỀU TIẾT MẠNG LƯỚI NƯỚC THÔNG MINH TỪ XA, GIẢM THẤT THOÁT NƯỚC CHO QUÝ KHÁCH HÀNG...</p><img src=\\"https://scontent.fsgn8-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/643879333_2011024139796384_5187620801252991790_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s590x590_tt6&amp;amp;_nc_cat=109&amp;amp;ccb=1-7&amp;amp;_nc_sid=7b2446&amp;amp;_nc_eui2=AeGsEYQOsPaXvWPu8tFz212cAvVbsOaP8bUC9Vuw5o_xtRkFPke9YQf3NcFCCNX_80cc6-7aBBOuR8RARZWtd8X1&amp;amp;_nc_ohc=CJ_BZvKdgaUQ7kNvwEIuc1b&amp;amp;_nc_oc=AdmbNMcT9KbQkQ2MzkXULz0zdWW_SpR7ZrlgKRtubPcsU85xImi0AyX_KKEiWTko-ecv6-XsY4GDib9KrGW7FUCL&amp;amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fsgn8-3.fna&amp;amp;_nc_gid=qmuRa4bBa_siohGYbhfGQQ&amp;amp;_nc_ss=8&amp;amp;oh=00_Afzwq1S5s3iyktpfp3xXab91R9OdA4KUD5aUfNG3Ktf2KA&amp;amp;oe=69BAD591\\" data-align=\\"center\\" class=\\"align-center\\"><img src=\\"https://scontent.fsgn8-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/643508406_2011024233129708_567253611715115562_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s590x590_tt6&amp;amp;_nc_cat=110&amp;amp;ccb=1-7&amp;amp;_nc_sid=7